    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Gameplay:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration Your Way</strong>: Choose between Stealth, Weapons, Defense, or Diplomacy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully Interactive Universe</strong>: Travel without loading screens across a procedurally generated universe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adaptive Research System</strong>: Unlock ship upgrades by salvaging/trading alien tech or discovering scientific phenomena.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What\u2019s Different:</strong> Most space games simulate a scaled-down or segmented universe. In <i>No End</i>, the universe is <strong>completely seamless and 1:1 in scale</strong>\u2014no loading screens, and the celestial distances are realistically vast.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Gameplay:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration Your Way</strong>: Choose between Stealth, Weapons, Defense, or Diplomacy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully Interactive Universe</strong>: Travel without loading screens across a procedurally generated universe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adaptive Research System</strong>: Unlock ship upgrades by salvaging/trading alien tech or discovering scientific phenomena.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What\u2019s Different:</strong> Most space games simulate a scaled-down or segmented universe. In <i>No End</i>, the universe is <strong>completely seamless and 1:1 in scale</strong>\u2014no loading screens, and the celestial distances are realistically vast.</p>",
    "short_description": "Explore a seamless endless universe with an uncountable number of galaxies, stars, planets, and moons. Make friends or enemies with unique alien civilizations. Research upgrades for your vessel with scientific phenomena and alien tech that you've acquired.",
